[Max All Skill Levels]
author=IRISHDEVELOPERDEV (from Code Master's NTSC-U CodeBreaker 'Advanced Game Variable' codes; hook verified in the USA ELF SLUS_213.85)
description=[TESTED] Maxes Fighting, Shooting, Health/Toughness, Speed and Street Smarts (level 10) and sets Respect level to 50, automatically. The values are written into your real stats, so they are saved with your game.
// USA hook 0x0028FBBC (= Code Master's USA CodeBreaker hook; PAL 0x0028FBCC): orig C4400008 lwc1 $f0,8($v0) -> j 0x000C0100.
//   Only reached when the lookup returned an entry (beql $v0,$zero at 0x0028FBB4 skips it); $s0 holds the out pointer (move $s0,$a2 at 0x0028FBB0), so $a0/$a2 are free.
// Cave 0x000C0100 unchanged except the return: PAL j 0x0028FBD0 (080A3EF4) -> USA j 0x0028FBC0 (080A3EF0), delay slot re-runs lwc1 $f0,8($v0).
// Table 0x000C0180 (6 x {hash, float}) unchanged: hashes are region-independent (lowercase x65599 of the stat names; Street Smarts hash from the USA list).
patch=1,EE,200C0100,extended,3C04000C
patch=1,EE,200C0104,extended,24840180
patch=1,EE,200C0108,extended,24060000
patch=1,EE,200C010C,extended,8C810000
patch=1,EE,200C0110,extended,14250002
patch=1,EE,200C0114,extended,8C810004
